{"seq":1,"slug":"debris-physics","title":"碎块物理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-destruction-systems/simulation/debris-physics","wordCount":1912,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"碎块物理\">碎块物理</h1><p>连接断了，一块混凝土从墙上脱落——从这一刻起，它不再是连接图上的一个节点，而是一个真正在世界里翻滚、碰撞、最终停下的刚体。碎块物理讲的就是这个「脱落后怎么动」的过程。它大量复用<a href=\"../../game-physics/\">游戏物理</a>的通用刚体机制，本篇只聚焦破坏特有的部分：碎块的质量惯性怎么来、成百上千个碎块如何分组求解、以及它们如何快速安静下来以省 CPU。通用的牛顿力学、碰撞检测、积分器请回链游戏物理，不在此重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>碎块物理指碎块从连接图释放、成为独立刚体后的运动与求解。它复用通用刚体动力学，破坏特有的部分有三：<strong>质量属性自动计算</strong>——碎块是离线切出的凸多面体，质量与惯性张量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 必须从几何算出而非手填，否则转动会失真；<strong>求解岛（island）分组</strong>——相互接触或约束相连的刚体归为一组独立求解，与连接图的成簇是两个层次（成簇合并为一个刚体，island 是多个刚体因接触分组）；<strong>激活与休眠</strong>——速度连续低于阈值的刚体退出求解，是破坏「瞬增速降」负载曲线省 CPU 的命门。此外，因 Voronoi 碎块天生为凸，理想碰撞代理即其自身凸包，极小碎屑可退化为球/盒甚至不参与碰撞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"碎块的质量与惯性张量\">碎块的质量与惯性张量</h2><p>一个普通刚体的质量属性通常由美术手填或按包围盒估算，但碎块是<a href=\"../fracture/voronoi-fracture\">Voronoi 碎裂</a>在离线阶段临时切出来的凸多面体，形状千奇百怪，必须<strong>从几何自动计算</strong>质量属性，否则运动会明显失真。</p>\n<p>对密度均匀的凸多面体，质量为体积乘密度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m = \\rho V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>，质心为几何形心。真正关键的是惯性张量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>，它决定碎块转起来「顺不顺」。绕质心的惯性张量是一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 对称矩阵：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>V</mi></msub><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>r</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = \\int_V \\rho \\, \\big( \\|r\\|^2 \\mathbf{E} - r r^{\\top} \\big)\\, dV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2719em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.4336em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2491em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是体元到质心的位移，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是单位矩阵。对多面体，这个积分有闭式解（按四面体分解求和）。惯性张量算错的典型症状是碎块转动太快或太慢、像被无形的力拽着——因为求解器用的角动量与实际形状不匹配。这些质量属性在离线碎裂时就一次算好、随几何集合烘焙进资产，运行时直接取用，避免帧内积分开销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"island-分组与求解\">island 分组与求解</h2><p>破坏最吓人的场景是「上百个碎块同屏」。物理引擎不会把它们当一个巨大的整体来解，而是按接触关系分成一个个<strong>求解岛（island）</strong>：相互接触或通过约束相连的刚体归为一个 island，不接触的 island 之间彼此独立、可并行求解。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[所有活跃碎块] --&gt; B[宽相: 找潜在接触对]&#10;  B --&gt; C[按接触/约束连通&lt;br/&gt;划分 island]&#10;  C --&gt; D[island 1]&#10;  C --&gt; E[island 2]&#10;  C --&gt; F[island N]&#10;  D --&gt; G[各 island 独立求解&lt;br/&gt;可分线程并行]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[更新碎块位姿]&#10;  H --&gt; I{island 内全部低速?}&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[整岛休眠]&#10;  I --&gt;|否| A\">flowchart TD\n  A[所有活跃碎块] --&gt; B[宽相: 找潜在接触对]\n  B --&gt; C[按接触/约束连通&lt;br/&gt;划分 island]\n  C --&gt; D[island 1]\n  C --&gt; E[island 2]\n  C --&gt; F[island N]\n  D --&gt; G[各 island 独立求解&lt;br/&gt;可分线程并行]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[更新碎块位姿]\n  H --&gt; I{island 内全部低速?}\n  I --&gt;|是| J[整岛休眠]\n  I --&gt;|否| A</pre><p>island 划分与<a href=\"../fracture/fracture-graph\">断裂连接图</a>里的成簇是两个层次：成簇是「仍连在一起的碎块合并为一个刚体」，island 是「多个独立刚体因接触被分到一组求解」。一个刚体簇在物理里就是一个刚体，会作为一个整体参与 island 划分。island 的价值在于把一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 体问题拆成多个小问题，既缩小了每个约束求解器要处理的矩阵规模，也天然适合<a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/cpu/multithreading-jobs\">多线程</a>——不同 island 派给不同工作线程互不干扰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"激活与休眠-破坏省-cpu-的命门\">激活与休眠：破坏省 CPU 的命门</h2><p>碎块脱落后会翻滚一阵，然后停下。如果停下后还继续每帧求解，几十块静止的废墟会白白吃满 CPU。**休眠（sleeping）**机制专治这一点：当一个刚体的线速度和角速度连续若干帧都低于阈值，就把它标记为休眠，从活跃列表移除，不再参与求解，直到被新的碰撞或事件唤醒。</p>\n<p>对破坏系统，休眠尤其关键，因为破坏的负载曲线是「瞬间暴增、然后迅速回落到零」——爆炸那一帧几十块全激活，理想情况下一两秒内它们应全部休眠归零。因此破坏系统会把休眠阈值调得比普通物体更激进：宁可让碎块「早一点」停住（哪怕还在极缓慢地滑动），也要尽快让它退出求解。判断休眠常用速度阈值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>sleep</mtext></msub><mtext> 且 </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>ω</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mtext>sleep</mtext></msub><mtext> 持续 </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>sleep</mtext></msub><mtext> 秒</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\|\\vec{v}\\| &lt; v_{\\text{sleep}} \\ \\text{且}\\ \\|\\vec{\\omega}\\| &lt; \\omega_{\\text{sleep}}\\ \\text{持续}\\ T_{\\text{sleep}}\\ \\text{秒}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sleep</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sleep</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">持续</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sleep</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">秒</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>激进的休眠会带来一个副作用——碎块可能在还没完全停稳时就「冻」住，视觉上略显突兀。这是<a href=\"debris-management\">碎屑管理与 LOD</a>里要权衡的取舍之一，通常配合淡出让玩家注意不到。</p>\n<h2 id=\"碰撞代理的简化\">碰撞代理的简化</h2><p>碎块的渲染网格可能有内部切面、凹陷、细节，但物理引擎最爱凸形。因为 Voronoi 碎块<strong>天生是凸的</strong>，所以最理想情况下每个碎块的碰撞形状就是它自己的凸包，无需额外简化——这是选 Voronoi 而非任意切割的又一好处。但在两种情况下仍需进一步简化碰撞代理：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情况</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>简化手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>碎块面数仍偏高</td>\n<td>凸包顶点太多，碰撞慢</td>\n<td>减顶点凸包（凸包近似）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极小碎屑</td>\n<td>数量多但视觉贡献小</td>\n<td>用球/盒代理，甚至不参与碰撞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>远处碎块</td>\n<td>玩家看不清</td>\n<td>更粗代理或纯运动学</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>极小碎屑常常干脆退化成「只受重力、与地面简单碰撞、彼此不碰」的近似，因为让上百个小屑互相精确碰撞既贵又无视觉收益，这又回到<a href=\"../foundations/why-destruction\">为何要做破坏系统</a>里「感知优先于精确」的原则。碰撞检测本身的宽相/窄相细节属于通用物理，见 <a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/narrow-phase\">游戏物理 · 碰撞检测</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数值稳定性陷阱\">数值稳定性陷阱</h2><p>大量碎块堆叠时，最常见的问题是<strong>堆叠抖动</strong>（jitter）：一堆碎块本应静止堆着，却持续微微颤动、甚至慢慢「渗」开。根源是接触约束在一帧内没被完全解开、残余穿透被求解器反复推挤。缓解手段包括提高求解器迭代次数、开启接触缓存与 warm-starting、以及前面说的激进休眠——让堆稳的碎块尽早休眠，就不给抖动机会。堆叠稳定性的通用求解技巧见 <a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-response/stacking-stability\">游戏物理 · 堆叠稳定性</a>。另一个陷阱是极小碎块的高速运动会穿透薄墙（隧穿），需要连续碰撞检测（CCD），但 CCD 很贵，通常只对少数大碎块开启。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>碎块的质量与惯性张量必须从凸多面体几何离线自动计算并随资产烘焙，算错会导致转动失真。</li>\n<li>物理引擎按接触/约束把碎块分成求解岛（island）独立且可并行求解，与连接图的成簇是不同层次。</li>\n<li>休眠是破坏省 CPU 的命门：破坏负载「瞬增速降」，需比普通物体更激进地让碎块尽早退出求解。</li>\n<li>Voronoi 碎块天生是凸的，理想碰撞代理就是自身凸包；极小碎屑退化为球/盒或不参与碰撞。</li>\n<li>大量堆叠易抖动，靠迭代数、warm-starting、激进休眠缓解；高速小碎块的隧穿需谨慎开启 CCD。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>碎块间连接怎么用物理约束表达：<a href=\"joint-constraints\">约束与连接</a></li>\n<li>碎块数量控制与销毁：<a href=\"debris-management\">碎屑管理与 LOD</a></li>\n<li>跨库：通用刚体动力学与积分，见 <a href=\"../../game-physics/rigid-body-dynamics/rigid-body-simulation\">游戏物理 · 刚体模拟</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"碎块物理","id":"碎块物理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"碎块的质量与惯性张量","id":"碎块的质量与惯性张量"},{"level":2,"text":"island 分组与求解","id":"island-分组与求解"},{"level":2,"text":"激活与休眠：破坏省 CPU 的命门","id":"激活与休眠-破坏省-cpu-的命门"},{"level":2,"text":"碰撞代理的简化","id":"碰撞代理的简化"},{"level":2,"text":"数值稳定性陷阱","id":"数值稳定性陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"应力传播","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-destruction-systems/fracture/stress-propagation"},"next":{"title":"约束与连接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-destruction-systems/simulation/joint-constraints"}}